1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,682
Then the narrator catches himself.

2
00:00:02,682 --> 00:00:09,518
He had smiled at Runtu for wanting an incense burner and candlesticks, still worshipping idols.

3
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:16,445
But what is his own hope for a new life, except an idol he has made himself, only further away?

4
00:00:16,445 --> 00:00:21,158
It is irony turned on himself, and it is what makes the ending honest.

